  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 24-layer HfO2/SiO2 multilayer stack on Fused Silica substrate with air incident medium. Layer sequence: HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2 (24 finite layers total). Initialize thicknesses from round-1 best candidate [52.925, 78.239, 46.246, 72.785, 56.794, 81.495, 56.456, 85.034, 46.691, 67.482, 55.395, 99.936, 80.226, 98.974, 64.858, 99.561, 79.560, 101.037, 65.886, 108.828, 81.886, 93.254, 72.435, 74.302] nm with ±3% multiplicative perturbation. Apply L-BFGS-B optimization with soft penalty on adjacent-layer thickness difference (max 7.0 nm absolute). Optimize for maximum transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band and maximum reflectance in 400-700 nm band at normal incidence, unpolarized light. Run three optimization rounds with tightest_margin derivative penalty before unconstrained exploration. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 1530-1565 nm, 400-700 nm. soft objectives: High transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band; High reflectance in 400-700 nm band. behaviors to suppress or avoid: Low reflectance in 1530-1565 nm band; Low transmittance in 400-700 nm band. manufacturing constraints: Maximum 30 layers.",
  "normalized_request_english": "Optimize a 24-layer alternating HfO2/SiO2 stack on fused-silica substrate with air incidence for maximum transmission in 1530–1565 nm and maximum reflection in 400–700 nm at normal incidence, unpolarized light, using L-BFGS-B with initial thicknesses derived from specified values and ±3% relative tolerance.",
